      "index": 0,
      "text": "Harbinger forces are about to land outside [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreCordiaCity],Cordia City]] but we might have detected a possible opportunity to disrupt their final assault.\n\nSince the beginning we have noticed that several DropShips were being kept back at the <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreOrionsBelt],Orion's Belt]]</i>, as a tactical reserve, and they are landing now.",
