    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5fec0bdf47a67beb18d225"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "My <i>Kintaro</i> will be carrying one of the armed nuclear warheads with me on the controls, Yang.\n\nOnce we reach the landing zone of their command DropShip, I will deploy it and leave as quickly as possible before we detonate it remotely.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cedaca0fbe8d7a6acaa6697"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce0a9f26c845ef2312cad53"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Timing the arrival of the Harbinger's <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreUnion],Union]]</i> DropShip is not going to be easy, Lady Arano.\n\nYou may find yourself out of time very easily and have no time to escape after placing the warhead on the landing zone or be delayed.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "What happens if you can't leave, your Highness?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c294899cbf311302bd32c2b"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3a06230355c18000067",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb0adee30cf1b1107b98de8"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "I will deploy the weapon whenever I have the chance to take out the Harbinger leadership, even if it means my 'Mech is still carrying it.\n\nAnd once their leaders are gone, the rest will have to decide if they want to die in more atomic clouds.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c77c2f839c5ee33501a6ff2"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
