            "functionName": "Set BattleTech Camera Lock",
            "args": [
              {
                "int_value": 0,
                "bool_value": false,
                "float_value": 0.0,
                "string_value": "AUTO",
                "call_value": null,
                "variableref_value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c82953bf878be4074839ab2"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "That's... that's assuming we can we leave, with the <i>Orion's Belt</i> about to arrive in orbit.\n\nAnd we definitely can't deploy your lance using our DropShips, Lady Arano.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c885fe784ea252119d353ba"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3a06230355c18000067",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5306e98542394231536fe9"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "It doesn't matter, no lance and no orbital insertion because we can't be detected approaching their landing zone until it is too late for them to reply.\n\nIf necessary I will have to detonate the warhead while still carrying it in my 'Mech.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 12,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cc0704e4c656235ae99d4ca"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c945677c2af5875012d0d68"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Our forces are all guarding the gates of Cardia City but they'll detect if we move any of them.\n\nSo we will need to use whatever else we have in storage, that is besides the <i>Kintaro</i> which is already being retrofitted. \n",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Yang, do we have anything else available for me to escort Lady Arano?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 13,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c599dc4804c90b2fbaa0987"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce70f5b5e2f4a5194a66c00"
      },
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Yeah some good news there, we have salvaged one of the Harbingers' improved <i>Phoenix Hawks</i>, you should love it sir.\n\nBut Captain Arano's <i>Kintaro</i> is still busted and we are already sweating just to replace armor and fix damage after losing the Refit Yards, so we need additional help to get it ready.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 14,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c636f69498246276009b0a5"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
